  "description": "The two became family when their parents remarried, but because of their violent father, the shelter provided by the name “family” didn’t last long. When Ja-Hui meets his younger brother Dong-U for the first time in a long while, after the void left by their parents’ divorce, he feels the emotions she once denied beginning to resurface... \n\n *“You like me even though I’m a brother like this? Enough to make you wet yourself?”*\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
